    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Oleg Tarassov",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105613185065391853807/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVhlrXGdK984V4ieJP4xmm6745MZimNpi4l3NsB0BOjie0RclnwRQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "When they say support local, people tend to think of food or stores related but it should not end there. This dealership is all about being true to a staying local. When we finally climbed the final step and was ready to stretch our hands and buy a Jeep, we had choices and we saw those choices. But only one stood out and its this team; Charles (owner) Team.\nNot only do you get flawless service when buying a car, you leave with assurance and a relationship through your car journey. Never in my six owned cars have I left with such warm feeling when purchasing our new car. Another special thanks to Brandon who helped and guided us in finding the right model for us.\n\nSincerely,\n\nOleg Tarassov",
        "time": 1691374885,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Samuel Archambault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117984676555911283349/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_QNlf0P-Gi1fkju1MOhaB0vp6DJmBD0aVLVlL0fRAMcUjQg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We purchased a vehicle in August 2025, and the after-sales support is very disappointing.\n\nOne week after the purchase, the \"check engine\" light came on, and after three appointments, they still haven't found the problem. The remote starter doesn't work, and it's cold. They've also lost the keys for the locking nuts. It's frustrating to pay for a new vehicle that doesn't work properly.\n\nUpdate: I'm upgrading to 4 stars. Eric Corvo handled our case, and we received good service afterward. Thank you, Eric! -1 star because it took a lot of effort to get decent after-sales service.",
        "time": 1768581309,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Louis Lacasse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117700596930011952419/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocImMwG-QOUEvDHUyXCFx3XdsxH6asFYlv0FSH89pq0aL0m03g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I purchased a used Ford truck from Excellence Chrysler. The representative, Mathieu Gauthier, was very professional and courteous, and he was very reassuring about the repairs that would be done on the vehicle, even ordering a new air conditioning compressor to be installed later. At delivery, Carine was just as professional. It was a pleasure doing business with you. Thank you very much.",
        "time": 1661264765,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "simon cloutier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114153539555314188911/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKyLyeZX5BEXCCKs2VViTUN_80oo2ucWinTo9HvExMl7oP9Cg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Thank you to Mohammad and Daniel for their excellent after-sales service and their friendly approach. Happy holidays to the entire Dodge family!",
